### Add customer an address
POST http://localhost:4001/customers/10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008/addresses
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fullAddress": "662 sk. cumhuriyet mh.",
    "city": "antalya",
    "country": "TR"
}

###

### Remove address from customer
DELETE http://localhost:4001/customers/10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011/addresses/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000014

